le picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> lone ruqia </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1761436800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text"><!-- R-CONTENT -->I don’t usually write reviews, but this one comes from a place of genuine appreciation and heartfelt gratitude. Sakshi is not just a designer or a businesswoman—she’s a miracle worker with a heart of gold. At a time when tensions between India and Pakistan escalated and the airports in Amritsar and Chandigarh were shut down, I had no hope of receiving my suit in time for my son’s wedding, But Sakshi made the impossible happen. Somehow, through chaos and uncertainty, she managed to get my suit delivered—and not just on time, but in impeccable condition. Who does that? Only someone who pours their soul into their work. What sets Sakshi apart is that she doesn’t just make clothes—she creates experiences. Every thread, every detail, every fitting reflects her passion and care. I am not writing this review for stars or praise—I am writing it because I am genuinely overwhelmed with happiness and satisfaction. The suit is beautiful beyond words, but even more beautiful is the relationship I feel we’ve built through this journey. I truly believe this is not just a customer-seller transaction. It’s the beginning of a long-lasting bond. Sakshi, thank you for not just delivering a suit but for delivering joy, trust, and something that will stay with me forever. If you’re reading this and wondering whether to go with her—stop wondering. You won’t just get great clothes. You’ll gain someone who works with honesty, love, and the kind of dedication that’s incredibly rare in today’s world.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIgzulX2F5KarxEaWGXDmnYG94IwCTyAePQjl2lTYHwp_ZFkw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIgzulX2F5KarxEaWGXDmnYG94IwCTyAePQjl2lTYHwp_ZFkw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Sarbjeet Kaur Sandhu profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Sarbjeet Kaur Sandhu </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-e